.TH "PB-CONFIG" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-config - Inspect the local CLI config


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb config [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Inspect the local CLI config

.PP
Show local configuration and synchronization commands. Use show for effective values, path for the active file, and status for repository synchronization. Interactive terminals open local config controls.

.PP
With --json, this command group lists its available commands.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for config


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print machine-readable JSON

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


